          "review": [{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"isha"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"I'm proud to own the Ather 450S. It's an amazing scooter with a futuristic design and comfortable ride. The only drawback is the limited range and lack of advanced features.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.8,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"srushti"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Ather 450S is a great option for city rides, offering a smooth ride and good performance. However, the charging time is a bit long.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.5,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"harish"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"I've enjoyed riding the 450S for its agility and comfort. However, the after-sales service experience could be improved.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"het"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The 450S is a good entry-level scooter, but it lacks in terms of advanced features and charging infrastructure support.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.2,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"dhaumya"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Ather 450S is a reliable scooter with a sporty feel. However, the range is limited, and more service centers would be beneficial.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"manas"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"I've been impressed with the 450S's handling and suspension. It's a joy to ride on both good and bad roads, though the pillion seat could be more comfortable.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.2,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"tilak"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Ather 450S is a solid choice for those seeking an affordable electric scooter. It's fun to ride, but the lack of advanced features is noticeable.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"jash"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"I love the 450S for its futuristic design and comfortable ride. It's a great value for money, though the range could be better for longer commutes.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.8,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"neel kuber"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Ather 450S offers a smooth ride and good performance. However, the charging time is a bit long, and more charging stations would be beneficial.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.5,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"dhruv thakkar"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"I've had mixed experiences with the 450S. While it's efficient and easy to handle, there have been some issues with after-sales service and display reliability.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.2,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"aashmini"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Ather 450S is a great choice for city rides. It's agile and fun to ride, though the pillion comfort could be improved.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"prabhat ranjan"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"I've been impressed with the 450S's design and build quality. It's comfortable to ride, but the lack of a touch display is noticeable compared to other models.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.8,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"abhishek tiwari"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Ather 450